 415+ 7CBC C2 06 7D         jp   nz, .vertical
 416+ 7CBF
 417+ 7CBF              .horizontal:
 418+ 7CBF DD 7E 06         ld   a, (ix+6)                 ; Direction (1 = Left, 2 = Right)
 419+ 7CC2 FE 01            cp   1
